1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:02,355
Every haunted house hides this machine.

2
00:00:02,355 --> 00:00:02,851
No fire.

3
00:00:02,851 --> 00:00:03,402
No smoke.

4
00:00:03,402 --> 00:00:07,757
Inside, a pump injects special fluid into a metal block hotter than your oven.

5
00:00:07,757 --> 00:00:09,466
The liquid flashes into vapor.

6
00:00:09,466 --> 00:00:11,615
And the instant it touches cold air...

7
00:00:11,615 --> 00:00:12,332
instant fog.

8
00:00:12,332 --> 00:00:13,710
You're not seeing smoke.

9
00:00:13,710 --> 00:00:15,970
You're walking through a man-made cloud.
